F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, November to December came in at 39% of normal and October to November at 52%. In 2026 so far on the middle, January to February and February to March both came in at 42%, then May to June came in at 129%. Grid 12193 had its driest year in 1990 at 56%.</p>"}
